均返回 200 且无内存告警（证据 #5, #6），进一步将故障范围限定在非业务主路径的 `/health` 端点或该端点运行时的极短暂崩溃瞬间。\n\n**未决事项：**\n*   应用 `/health` 端点返回 500 的具体业务代码逻辑原因（日志中未捕获到崩溃瞬间的具体报错）。\n*   是否存在极短瞬时的内存峰值导致 OOM（Exit 137 亦可能为 OOM Kill，但日志记录内存为 0 且无 OOMKilled 标记，当前证据倾向于非 OOM 或该指标在瞬间崩溃场景下不可见）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 156.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 156.1s (Evidence 143.4s, RCA 12.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 187.56, "metrics": {"run_id": "97cbf73518a74db8", "mttr": {"value": "3.1m", "seconds": 187.55920219421387, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer